ost favorable of these is +3000. So the reason evaluates the desirability of achieving +3000 with 50% vs. +1000 with 100%. If the weighting is linear, 0.5 × 3000 = 1500 > 1000, so A is preferred. Therefore, the decision reason, when applicable, leads to a preference for Lottery A.",
